#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/026/StmBdz117_02667:TEXT_STMBDZ117_02667_TIMIDWOMAN02667_000_003:1"
msgid "I am far too modest a mouse to show my anger. Would you go and show the shopkeep Ibara how <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>angry</ui-edge-color></ui-color> I am in my stead? No doubt your wrath will serve to retrieve the gil I have been cheated of."
msgstr "Я слишком робкая, чтобы показать, как злюсь. Не могли бы вы вместо меня показать торговке Ибаре, как я <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>разгневана</ui-edge-color></ui-color>? Ваш гнев наверняка поможет вернуть деньги, которые она у меня выманила."

#. ja: 私の代わりに、イバラさんに「不満を表して」いただけませんか？<br>そして、お金を取り戻していただきたいんです。
#. de: Lass dich bitte nicht abwimmeln. Wenn du Ibara gegenüber deinen <i>Ärger</i> zum Ausdruck bringst, wird sie das zu viel gezahlte Geld bestimmt zurückgeben.
#. fr: Pourriez-vous en discuter avec madame Ibara et la convaincre de me rembourser la différence<nbsp>? N'hésitez pas à <i>vous fâcher</i>. C'est elle qui est en tort.
#. speaker: TIMIDWOMAN02667
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
